# Replit dev URL only

This workspace runs on Replit. The app is already served by managed workflows. Do not start, stop, kill, or restart them. Restarting opens duplicate ports. If a restart is needed, ask the user to restart the workflow in Replit. They will do that manually.

Managed workflows:

- `artifacts/atg-consulting: web`
- `artifacts/api-server: API Server`
- `artifacts/mockup-sandbox: Component Preview Server`

Leave each workflow's `PORT`, `BASE_PATH`, and proxy host as Replit set them.

Do not run a dev server from the shell (`vite`, `pnpm dev`, `pnpm --filter … run dev`, or `node`). Do not bind anything to `127.0.0.1` or `localhost`.

Verify the app only at:

https://3e58f60d-93ea-4e0d-91d8-799c20a3158f-00-2noc46nremglm.kirk.replit.dev/

Do not open `http://127.0.0.1:<port>`, `http://localhost:<port>`, or any other host. Hostname-derived config, including the Clerk publishable key, follows the page host.

One-off commands that are not a server — typecheck, tests, installs, builds — can still run in the shell.
